  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d21438f07bf2e8446b0a1da7bf64f675, type: 3}
  m_Name: Day3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dayNumber: 3
  storyText: "The canteen cats are still on the roof. The fat orange one hasn't moved
    in three days. We're not sure if it's dead or just doesn't care anymore. This
    morning, we saw someone on the other side of the courtyard. He was trying to
    reach the mango tree between the dormitory and the canteen. He didn't make it.
    A zombie grabbed his ankle before he could climb. He screamed. We watched from
    the window. We didn't help. We couldn't. By the time the zombie finished, three
    more had joined. The mangoes are still on the tree. The cats finally moved \u2014
    they ran inside the canteen. Even they know when to be scared."
